OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker 'marauded' across
OL,4,Aweekend, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man accused of carrying out an
OL,7,Fattack on a train in Cambridgeshire
OL,8,Facross Halloween weekend last year
OL,9,Fmarauded through towns and cities armed
OL,10,Fwith a knife, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams, 33, has gone on trial
OL,13,Faccused of trying to kill 10 people on
OL,14,Fa train which had to make an emergency
OL,15,Fstop in Huntingdon on 1 November 2025,
OL,16,Fas well as three others the day before
OL,17,Fin Peterborough and one earlier that
OL,18,Fsame day at a London railway station.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
