OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker 'marauded' across
OL,4,Aweekend, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the case, prosecutor
OL,7,FChristopher Paxton KC said that of
OL,8,Fthose on the train "some stood tall, to
OL,9,Fprotect others trying to de-escalate
OL,10,Fhis rampage".
OL,12,FWilliams, of Langford Road in
OL,13,FPeterborough, denies 14 counts of
OL,14,Fattempted murder.
